  "content_id": "16136178",
  "title": "Apple Pay Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Quick help for Apple Pay transaction issues across Edge's partners. Please find which partner is relevant to your transaction. \nBanxa\nWhy ...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Quick help for Apple Pay transaction issues across Edge's partners. Please find which partner is relevant to your transaction.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Banxa</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Unsupported region or card for Apple Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Incorrect authorization entry</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank declined the transaction</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try a different card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use another payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete KYC</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact Banxa if still stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Banxa Support</b></a><b>: <a href=\"https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new</a></b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>MoonPay</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Insufficient funds or unsupported card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Apple Pay card not 3D Secure</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Incomplete MoonPay verification</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Security filter or limit exceeded</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a 3D Secure-enabled card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete MoonPay KYC</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check for emails from MoonPay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.moonpay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> <b>Contact MoonPay Support</b></a><b>: https://support.moonpay.com/</b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Paybis</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Transaction flagged as risky</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Apple Pay card not accepted</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank blocked the payment</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry after 24 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try another card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete KYC on Paybis</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check for Paybis email alerts</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.paybis.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> <b>Contact Paybis Support</b></a><b>: https://support.paybis.com/</b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Simplex</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Invalid Apple Pay setup or card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Verification incomplete</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank blocked the charge</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Exceeded Simplex limits</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a valid, verified card with Apple Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Finish Simplex verification</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Look for messages from Simplex</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Simplex Support</b></a><b>: https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT</b></p></li></ol>",
